			"notes": "**Language Mod is now called Say It Or Lose It.** Minecraft 1.21.11, Fabric.\n\n### Changes\n- New name: the in-game name, the chat prefix (`[Say It]`) and the jar name (`say-it-or-lose-it-0.2.0.jar`).\n- The voice model (`ggml-small-q5_1.bin`, 190 MB, from huggingface.co) is downloaded only after you say yes. The mod asks once in game. Choosing \"Not now\" means you type your answers, and you can download the model later from Settings (K).\n- Includes the 0.1.1 fix: Whisper loops can't disconnect you any more.\n\n### Updating\nRemove `language-mod-0.1.x.jar` from your `mods` folder and add `say-it-or-lose-it-0.2.0.jar`. Don't keep both. Your settings, dictionaries and downloaded voice model stay as they are.\n\nSHA-256 of the jar: `e660188ace85757dce6f8eca84dc5f4eb044cdddd81efc3fda9ba8546eb7f79e`"
