			"notes": "Bug fix for **Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric)**.\n\n### Fixed\n- **Being disconnected from the world while using voice.** On short or unclear audio, Whisper sometimes repeats one syllable over and over (seen with Hebrew: 263 characters for 1 second of audio). That answer was too long for the game's network packet, so the game disconnected you. Such loops are now ignored, and every answer is capped at 100 characters.\n\n### Updating from 0.1.0\nRemove `language-mod-0.1.0.jar` from your `mods` folder and add `language-mod-0.1.1.jar`. Don't keep both. Your settings and dictionaries stay as they are.\n\nSHA-256 of the jar: `29bb860ac4039d2b8bfe621c6cba1d3958ccb8c4ffda64c24421edc77dc5398b`"
		},
