			"notes": "First release of Language Mod for **Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric)**.\n\nEvery new item you pick up pops up with its name in the language you're learning. Say it (or type it) before the timer runs out, or take damage (and optionally lose the item).\n\n### Install\n1. Fabric Loader 0.17+ for Minecraft 1.21.11, plus [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api).\n2. Put `language-mod-0.1.0.jar` in your `mods` folder.\n3. On first use the voice model (`ggml-small-q5_1.bin`, 190 MB, from Hugging Face) downloads by itself.\n\n### What's in it\n- Popup with item icon, word to read, time bar; wrong letters shown in red\n- Voice answers on your own PC (whisper.cpp), open mic or push-to-talk; optional NVIDIA GPU mode (~0.2 s per answer)\n- Typed answers in chat (kept private)\n- Your dictionary (J) with spaced reviews; settings screen (K)\n- Romanian, Spanish, Russian, Hebrew; switch any time, separate progress per language\n- Works on servers without the mod (client-only mode)\n\nSee the [README](https://github.com/AvinadavCoh/minecraft-language-mod#readme) for keys, GPU setup and config files.\n\nSHA-256 of the jar: `7bfff887e09a60332747d845ab00567fb95b5977958bfc75f8a8cbd73cdd8511`"
